# prime-claw tier-1 Prime Agent selection.
#
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and set EXACTLY ONE selector. Pinned mode is the
# only executable mode in testing-strategy Slice 1. Source mode is retained as
# an explicit selector but fails before the checkout is read or mutated; the
# isolated source builder lands in Slice 2 (prime-claw-5v7.1).
#
# Released Prime Agent via the vendor installer:
#   PRIME_AGENT_PINNED=0.9.8
#
# Deferred source selector (currently fails closed; never point automation at
# an operator checkout until Slice 2 lands):
#   PRIME_AGENT_SOURCE=/absolute/path/to/prime-agent
#
# Format: plain KEY=value lines, no inline comments. An empty value counts as
# unset. TIER1_ENV_FILE may select another env file for tests.

PRIME_AGENT_PINNED=
# PRIME_AGENT_SOURCE=/absolute/path/to/prime-agent
